<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Annulation de réservation - Liife'is Good</title>
</head>

<body style="margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f4f6f8; font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color:#1f2937;">

  <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"
    style="background-color:#f4f6f8; padding:40px 15px;">

```
<tr>
  <td align="center">

    <!-- Carte principale -->
    <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"
      style="
        max-width:620px;
        background:#ffffff;
        border-radius:14px;
        overflow:hidden;
        box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
      ">

      <!-- Header -->
      <tr>
        <td style="
          background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1f4f8f,#2c6bb2);
          padding:35px 30px;
          text-align:center;
        ">

          <div style="
            font-size:28px;
            font-weight:bold;
            color:#ffffff;
            margin-bottom:8px;
          ">
            Liife'is Good
          </div>

          <div style="
            font-size:14px;
            color:#dbeafe;
          ">
            Complexe immobilier
          </div>

        </td>
      </tr>

      <!-- Icône annulation -->
      <tr>
        <td align="center" style="padding:35px 30px 10px;">

          <div style="
            width:64px;
            height:64px;
            line-height:64px;
            border-radius:50%;
            background:#fef2f2;
            color:#dc3545;
            font-size:30px;
            font-weight:bold;
            margin:auto;
          ">
            ×
          </div>

        </td>
      </tr>

      <!-- Contenu -->
      <tr>
        <td style="padding:15px 40px 35px;">

          <h1 style="
            margin:0 0 15px;
            text-align:center;
            font-size:25px;
            color:#1f2937;
          ">
            Réservation annulée
          </h1>

          <p style="
            margin:0 0 15px;
            font-size:16px;
            color:#374151;
          ">
            Bonjour <strong>{{guestName}}</strong>,
          </p>

          <p style="
            margin:0 0 25px;
            font-size:15px;
            line-height:1.7;
            color:#6b7280;
          ">
            Nous vous informons que votre réservation a été
            <strong style="color:#dc3545;">annulée</strong>.
          </p>

          <!-- Détails réservation -->
          <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"
            style="
              background:#f8fafc;
              border:1px solid #e5e7eb;
              border-radius:10px;
              overflow:hidden;
            ">

            <tr>
              <td colspan="2" style="
                padding:18px 20px;
                background:#f1f5f9;
                border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;
                font-size:16px;
                font-weight:bold;
                color:#1f2937;
              ">
                Informations de la réservation
              </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
              <td style="
                padding:18px 20px 8px;
                font-size:14px;
                color:#6b7280;
              ">
                Référence
              </td>

              <td align="right" style="
                padding:18px 20px 8px;
                font-size:14px;
                font-weight:bold;
                color:#1f2937;
              ">
                {{reference}}
              </td>
            </tr>

            {{#if reason}}
            <tr>
              <td style="
                padding:8px 20px 18px;
                font-size:14px;
                color:#6b7280;
                vertical-align:top;
              ">
                Motif
              </td>

              <td align="right" style="
                padding:8px 20px 18px;
                font-size:14px;
                font-weight:bold;
                color:#dc3545;
                vertical-align:top;
              ">
                {{reason}}
              </td>
            </tr>
            {{/if}}

          </table>

          <!-- Information -->
          <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"
            style="
              margin-top:22px;
              background:#fff7ed;
              border-left:4px solid #f59e0b;
              border-radius:6px;
            ">

            <tr>
              <td style="
                padding:14px 16px;
                font-size:13px;
                line-height:1.6;
                color:#475569;
              ">
                <strong style="color:#c2410c;">
                  Besoin d'aide ?
                </strong>
                <br>
                Si vous avez des questions concernant cette annulation,
                notre équipe reste à votre disposition pour vous accompagner.
              </td>
            </tr>

          </table>

          <p style="
            margin:28px 0 5px;
            font-size:15px;
            color:#374151;
          ">
            Nous sommes désolés pour tout désagrément occasionné.
          </p>

          <p style="
            margin:0;
            font-size:15px;
            font-weight:bold;
            color:#1f2937;
          ">
            L'équipe Liife'is Good
          </p>

        </td>
      </tr>

      <!-- Footer -->
      <tr>
        <td style="
          background:#f8fafc;
          border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;
          padding:25px 30px;
          text-align:center;
        ">

          <p style="
            margin:0 0 8px;
            font-size:13px;
            font-weight:bold;
            color:#374151;
          ">
            Liife'is Good
          </p>

          <p style="
            margin:0 0 12px;
            font-size:12px;
            color:#9ca3af;
          ">
            Complexe immobilier
          </p>

          <p style="
            margin:0;
            font-size:11px;
            line-height:1.5;
            color:#9ca3af;
          ">
            Cet email est une notification automatique concernant
            l'annulation de votre réservation.
            <br>
            Merci de ne pas répondre directement à cet email.
          </p>

        </td>
      </tr>

    </table>

    <!-- Copyright -->
    <p style="
      margin:20px 0 0;
      text-align:center;
      font-size:11px;
      color:#9ca3af;
    ">
      © Liife'is Good — Tous droits réservés.
    </p>

  </td>
</tr>
```

  </table>

</body>
</html>
